country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAMACHIYO, YOSHINORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, HIROKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KANEDA, KAZUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAGATA, NORIMITSU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Foods for preventing vomiting which comprise a solution containing one or more thickening materials selected from among leumethoxylpectin, sodium alginate, alginic acid,  kappa -carrageenan,  iota -carrageenan,  lambda -carrageenan and gellan gum; foods for preventing vomiting which comprise a solution of such a thickening material coupled typically with a calcium solution; and a method for preventing or checking vomiting caused by the intake of fluid diet by taking these foods.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne des produits alimentaires anti-émétiques. Ces produits comprennent une solution qui renferme des matières épaississantes du tape leumethoxylpectine, algine, acide alginique,  kappa -carragénine,  iota -caragénine,  lambda -carragénine et gomme gellane. L'invention concerne des denrées alimentaires renfermant une solution de matière épaississante de ce type avec une solution de calcium ainsi qu'une méthode faisant appel à de telles denrées pour prévenir ou arrêter des vomissements dus à une alimentation liquide.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all rig